Feature: Read every source entry's preparation without granting native authority
  C008 is one frozen S unit under H002 and LP-LEARN.
  Accepted C003 and C005 are the entry gates, not new implementation work.

  Scenario: Open any of the 150 scenarios or two workflows
    Given the unchanged immutable C005 catalog and its validated 1.0.0 contract
    And the unchanged C003 documented matrix and C001 local approval artifact
    When a visitor selects a stable source ID and opens preparation
    Then its exact objective, implementation, acceptance and source-row links appear
    And its additional prerequisites retain their original AND/OR notation
    And scenarios retain BASE while workflows retain their own stated prerequisites
    And all 152 entries have preparation even when no portable exercise is available

